1
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,320
If it were you,

2
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,000
you would have saved me too.

3
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,480
You have so much confidence in me.

4
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,320
Wouldn't you save me?

5
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,320
Take a guess.

6
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:41,800
Gu Qingyu,

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,240
what are you doing?

8
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:41,520
You're awake.

9
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:43,160
How are you feeling? Any pain?

10
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,640
Should I call the doctor?

11
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,400
I'm fine.

12
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,720
I'm just

13
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:58,440
a bit thirsty.

14
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,120
Are

15
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,080
you okay?

16
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,200
Yesterday I...

17
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:18,960
I'm fine.

18
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,520
You saved me.

19
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,640
But that car...

20
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:22,800
The police have been here.

21
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,000
They said it was an accident

22
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,760
due to the slippery road,

23
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:27,880
and the driver was drunk

24
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:29,960
and lost control.

25
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,040
It was just an accident.

26
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:41,920
Yesterday,

27
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,520
I forgot to tell you,

28
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,360
happy birthday.

29
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,920
Look at you,

30
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:54,240
so busy you forgot your own birthday.

31
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,760
Isn't October 27th your birthday?

32
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,400
Tian.

33
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,360
Tian.

34
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,720
Are you okay?

35
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,240
Are you feeling unwell?

36
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,800
Or are you scared?

37
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,160
[Gu Qingyu.]

38
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,680
[Guan Tian.]

39
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,120
[Who are you?]

40
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,080
Xintian,

41
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:02,240
[How many secrets are you hiding?]

42
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,240
What happened?

43
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,800
What's wrong? Was there a car accident?

44
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,000
I'm fine.

45
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:18,440
It was just a scare.

46
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,360
What would you do

47
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,000
if you discovered that something you've always believed in

48
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,560
is not what you thought it was?

49
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,200
What would you do?

50
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,320
Is it related to Lin Jiming

51
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,320
Or

52
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,280
it's related to the thing three years ago.

53
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,600
No matter what you find,

54
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,520
remember not to be impulsive.

55
00:04:58,640 --> 00:04:59,840
What the law and justice need

56
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,240
is evidence,

57
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,560
not lynching.

58
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,840
Don't get yourself into trouble.

59
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,000
I know.

60
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:25,600
I just need some time.

61
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,600
You're useless!

62
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,480
You can't even handle this small matter,

63
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,840
and even let Jiming get hurt.

64
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,760
Are you too soft to do it?

65
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:42,000
No.

66
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,720
Jiming suddenly rushed out

67
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:45,920
and pushed her away.

68
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,600
Wu Zhanshan,

69
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,800
I think you're getting worse as you get older.

70
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:00,760
You...

71
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,320
Wen Shiyi,

72
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,440
he's my son.

73
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:06,440
He's my own son.

74
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:07,760
I saw him

75
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:08,520
being hit

76
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,760
by me.

77
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,640
He's still lying in the hospital.

78
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,680
How can I

79
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:16,720
meet him in the future?

80
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,800
How can I face him?

81
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,000
Your son?

82
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,840
Remember your identity.

83
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,400
He is Lin Jiming,

84
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,760
the future master of Lin Group.

85
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:30,280
You are just his driver.

86
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:31,280
Understand?

87
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:35,920
Mr. Lin,

88
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:36,880
do you need to be transferred?

89
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,080
No,

90
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,720
it's not a big deal.

91
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:42,160
Here are the documents you need to sign.

92
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,440
Bring me my pen.

93
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:08,960
Alright, take it back.

94
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,640
Contact me by phone if necessary.

95
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,320
Everything is going well at the company.

96
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,200
Please rest assured and focus on recovery.

97
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,120
Thank you, Guan Lu.

98
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,680
Actually,

99
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:38,040
I know it's not an accident.

100
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,840
That car

101
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,360
was heading for you, right?

102
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,320
Are you in trouble?

103
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:52,840
Tell me.

104
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:53,880
I can help you.

105
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:58,640
No.

106
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,640
It was just an accident.

107
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,160
Guan Tiantian,

108
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,480
I'm not stupid.

109
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:08,320
Your eyes are complicated every time you look at me.

110
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,640
Tell me.

111
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,200
Why are you

112
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:13,480
getting close to me?

113
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:17,720
Mr. Lin,

114
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,280
you just got hurt.

115
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:20,360
You need to rest more.

116
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:21,640
Don't overthink.

117
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,320
Isn't October 27th your birthday?

118
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,280
Yesterday.

119
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,600
I forgot to tell you.

120
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,520
Happy birthday.

121
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,240
I watched him grow up.

122
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:56,760
I'm Rh-negative.

123
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:57,520
I can do this.

124
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:58,440
Take mine.

125
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,520
Wen Shiyi.

126
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,440
Lin Jiming.

127
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,080
Who should I hate?

128
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,520
Who can I trust?

129
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:40,840
Why you?

130
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,040
[The truth]

131
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:58,440
[is like the moonlight,]

132
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,520
[which occasionally breaks through the clouds,]

133
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,640
[but cannot illuminate all the darkness.]

134
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,360
[And some choices,]

135
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,160
[once made,]

136
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:09,400
[can never be undone.]
